---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About">
  <section class="section row">
    <div class="rail mono">About</div>
    <div class="main prose" style="margin-top:0">
      <p>I'm Harish Kulur, an engineer who builds for the web.</p>
      <p>This site is a running record. I ship something regularly with the help of agents, and I write about whatever holds my attention, from code to cinema.</p>
      <p>Find me on <a href="https://github.com/hkulur">GitHub</a>, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/harishkulur/">LinkedIn</a> and <a href="https://x.com/hkulur">X</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section row">
    <div class="rail mono">Colophon</div>
    <div class="main prose" style="margin-top:0">
      <p>The name at the top is mine, written in Kannada. The text is set in Newsreader, the details in Geist Mono and the masthead in Noto Serif Kannada.</p>
      <p>Built with Astro, hosted on Cloudflare, and kept up with the help of Claude. Every entry is a Markdown file in <a href="https://github.com/hkulur/hkulur.com">a public repository</a>. The first entry went up on 20 October 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
